---
source: crates/opentide-esql/tests/parser_snapshots.rs
expression: "format!(\"{source}\\n{tree}--- errors\\n{errors}\")"
---
SET a = 1 FROM a
SOURCE_FILE@0..16
  SET_COMMAND@0..14
    SET_KW@0..3 "SET"
    WHITESPACE@3..4 " "
    IDENTIFIER@4..5
      IDENT@4..5 "a"
    WHITESPACE@5..6 " "
    EQ@6..7 "="
    WHITESPACE@7..8 " "
    QUALIFIED_INTERVAL@8..14
      NUMBER@8..9
        NUMBER_LIT@8..9 "1"
      WHITESPACE@9..10 " "
      TIME_UNIT@10..14
        IDENT@10..14 "FROM"
  WHITESPACE@14..15 " "
  QUERY@15..16
    ERROR@15..16
      WORD@15..16 "a"
--- errors
14..15: expected `;` after the setting (expected SEMI)
14..15: expected a source command (expected FROM_KW, TS_KW, ROW_KW, SHOW_KW, EXPLAIN_KW, SET_KW, SEMI)
